## Spectra: src/Spectra/*

Spectra, a header-only C++ library for large-scale eigenvalue problems.
https://github.com/yixuan/spectra

15 headers from commit db1d5cc3279752ca7ea3e33da44ba2a85e4e4a95 (four
commits after tag v1.2.0), copied without modification.
src/Spectra/MANIFEST lists each file with its git blob hash.

Copyright (C) 2016-2025 Yixuan Qiu <yixuan.qiu@cos.name>

src/Spectra/LinAlg/TridiagEigen.h is adapted from Eigen and also carries:

Copyright (C) 2008-2010 Gael Guennebaud <gael.guennebaud@inria.fr>
Copyright (C) 2010 Jitse Niesen <jitse@maths.leeds.ac.uk>

License: Mozilla Public License, version 2.0 (MPL-2.0)
https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/

Every file carries the MPL-2.0 notice in its header. None is marked
"Incompatible With Secondary Licenses", so MPL-2.0 section 3.3 permits
distributing them as part of this GPL (>= 2) package.
